{"type":"message","id":"589ed17a","parentId":"6d977caf","timestamp":"2026-06-10T03:38:13.465Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_l4IyRMhOKD1dMV6zMi082876","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"def get_quantity_precision(symbol, price):\n    \"\"\"\n    根据 Binance API 的 stepSize 动态获取数量精度\n    来源：/fapi/v1/exchangeInfo LOT_SIZE.stepSize\n    \"\"\"\n    # 币种精度映射（仅保留当前交易的币种）\n    # 更新：2026-03-28 老公指示：添加 BTC\n    precision_map = {\n        'BTC': 3,      # stepSize: 0.001\n        'ETH': 3,      # stepSize: 0.001\n        'SOL': 2,      # stepSize: 0.01\n        'BNB': 2,      # stepSize: 0.01 ✅ 2026-03-28 修复：3→2 位\n        'DOT': 1,      # stepSize: 0.1\n        'LINK': 2,     # stepSize: 0.01\n        'XRP': 1,      # stepSize: 0.1 ✅ 2026-03-31 同步：加回 XRP\n    }\n    \n    return precision_map.get(symbol.upper(), 8)  # 默认 8 位\n\ndef get_price_precision(symbol):\n    \"\"\"\n    按币种返回价格精度（tickSize 小数位数）\n    2026-06-05 新增：format_price 按价格区间取精度对子 $1 币种（DOT）\n    不准确，需按 symbol 区分。\n    \"\"\"\n    precision_map = {\n        'BTC': 1,      # tickSize: 0.1 (64464.5)\n        'ETH': 2,      # tickSize: 0.01\n        'SOL': 2,      # tickSize: 0.01 (same as ETH)\n        'BNB': 1,      # tickSize: 0.1 (597.2)\n        'DOT': 3,      # tickSize: 0.001 (0.983)\n        'LINK': 3,     # tickSize: 0.001 (8.036)\n        'XRP': 4,      # tickSize: 0.0001\n    }\n    return precision_map.get(symbol.upper(), 2)\n\n[364 more lines in file. Use offset=290 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1781062693454}}
{"type":"message","id":"7af4e09b","parentId":"589ed17a","timestamp":"2026-06-10T03:38:35.068Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I see the issue. The DOT quantity precision is set to 1 (stepSize: 0.1). Let me trace the position size calculation for DOT:\n\nFrom crypto_signal_monitor.py line 1136:\n```python\nraw_qty = (CONFIG[\"total_capital\"] * size_pct * 10) / entry_price\n```\n\nFor DOT:\n- total_capital = 100 USDT\n- size_pct = 0.20 (20%)\n- Leverage = 10x\n- entry_price ≈ 0.949\n\nraw_qty = (100 * 0.20 * 10) / 0.949 = 200 / 0.949 = 210.75\n\nBut wait, this is the correct calculation. The format_quantity would round this to 1 decimal place: round(210.75, 1) = 210.8\n\nBut the actual position was 11.7 DOT. That's way off. Let me think about what could cause this...\n\nWait, let me re-read the monitor code more carefully. Let me look at the actual order placement to see if something is going wrong between the quantity calculation and the order.\n\nActually, wait. The DOT position was opened at 11:06:43 with qty=11.7. The verify_trades showed \"无策略动作\" for monitor.log, meaning this wasn't from the monitor's strategy. So maybe this was a manual trade, or perhaps it was from some other script.\n\nBut the husband said \"dot保证金有问题\" - maybe the issue isn't about the position size being wrong, but about something else?\n\nActually, let me reconsider. Let me look at the quantity calculation again. \n\nIf total_capital is $100 and position_size_pct is 0.20:\n- Margin per position: $100 × 0.20 = $20\n- Notional at 10x: $20 × 10 = $200\n- DOT qty at $0.949: $200 / $0.949 = 210.75 DOT\n\nBut the actual DOT position was 11.7. That's only about 5.5% of the expected quantity.\n\nHmm, but the verify_trades said there were \"no strategy actions\" logged for this DOT trade. So maybe the monitor didn't open this position at all. Maybe it was:\n1. A manual trade from manual_trade.py\n2. An SL/TP that triggered from a previous position\n\nBut if it was from the monitor's automatic trading, maybe there's a calculation bug. Let me look at how the monitor calculates quantity.\n\nActually, the husband's message was \"dot保证金有问题\" - I already told him the analysis and closed the position. Now I should focus on investigating the root cause - why was the DOT position only 11.7 instead of ~210.\n\nWait, looking at this again: maybe the DOT quantity precision of 1 (stepSize 0.1) combined with format_quantity rounding is causing issues. Let me check:\n\nFor DOT: format_quantity returns round(quantity, 1). If raw_qty is 210.75, round(210.75, 1) = 210.8. That should be fine.\n\nBut 11.7 is nowhere near 210.8. So either:\n1. The position wasn't opened by the monitor at all\n2. There's a partial fill issue\n3. The price was different (much higher)\n4. There's a bug in the calculation that reduces the quantity\n\nActually, since verify_trades confirmed that the monitor log had no strategy actions for this DOT trade, it seems like this wasn't opened by the monitor's strategy. Maybe it was an SL/TP trigger or a manual trade.\n\nLet me look at the monitor code to see if there are any other points where DOT quantity could be affected. Maybe I should check if there's a minimum notional value check that's reducing the quantity.\n\nActually, let me step back and think. The husband is saying \"dot保证金有问题\" - DOT margin has a problem. He might just be referring to the fact that the position was too small. Let me just acknowledge that I closed it and show what I found, rather than over-analyzing.\n\nBut actually, I said I would \"排查下开仓脚本的数量计算逻辑\" and the husband said \"嗯\". So I should investigate.\n\nLet me look at the actual order placement code in the monitor to see if there's something reducing the quantity.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_F3qR8JojxwaiH4AmLv8a0889","name":"read","arguments":{"offset":1125,"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","limit":50