{"type":"message","id":"14202719","parentId":"6c393d24","timestamp":"2026-06-10T03:39:00.419Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"No minNotional checks in the code. That's good - no quantity reduction filters.\n\nSo the conclusion is: the DOT position was 11.7 DOT = $11.10 notional = $1.11 margin (at 10x), which is way below the configured $20 margin. The monitor didn't log any strategy action for this DOT trade - meaning it wasn't opened by the monitor's strategy code.\n\nThe position was opened at 11:06:43 with the description in verify_trades saying \"可能有手动交易或 SL/TP 自动触发\". Since the husband is saying \"保证金有问题\", this could be:\n1. A residual position from a previous SL/TP trigger\n2. A manual trade\n\nThe quantity calculation code in the monitor looks correct:\n- raw_qty = (100 * 0.20 * 10) / 0.949 = 210.75 DOT\n- format_quantity rounds to 210.8 DOT (1 decimal precision for DOT)\n- The order would be placed for 210.8 DOT\n\nSo the issue isn't with the quantity calculation itself. The issue is that this specific DOT position wasn't created by the monitor's strategy - it was either a manual trade or SL/TP trigger that only had a tiny quantity.\n\nLet me present this clearly to the husband. I've already:\n1. Closed the DOT position ✅\n2. Verified the quantity calculation code is correct\n3. Found that the DOT position wasn't from the monitor's strategy (no log entries)\n\nI should tell him clearly what happened.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"排查完了，说一下结论：\n\n**这单 DOT 不是 monitor 策略开的。** verify_trades 确认 monitor 没有任何策略动作日志，但币安上确实有这笔 11:06 的成交 — 大概率是之前某个止盈止损挂单触发，或者手动下的，只剩了 11.7 DOT 的小尾巴。\n\n**数量计算逻辑本身没问题。** 按 configure 走：\n- 保证金 $100 × 20% = $20\n- 10x 杠杆名义 $200\n- DOT 价格 $0.949 → 应该开 ~210 DOT\n- `format_quantity` 精度 1 位小数 → round 到 210.8，正常\n\n所以问题不在代码，是这笔仓位本身就不是策略开的，属于残留仓位。已经帮你平掉了，现在仓位从 4 个变成 3 个，账面干净了 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input"