{"type":"message","id":"51fdc992","parentId":"1621a9b5","timestamp":"2026-06-10T10:38:20.944Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All old logs from March. The current monitor must be logging somewhere else. Let me check the OpenClaw gateway log for any recent trading activity, or check if the monitor is using a different log path.\n\nActually, let me just check the ETH position directly. Based on the position query:\n- ETH LONG, entry $1622, current $1625\n- PnL: +0.03 USDT\n\nThe PnL being only +0.03 with a $3 price move means: qty = 0.03 / 3 = 0.01 ETH.\n\nAt $1622 entry, 0.01 ETH = $16.22 notional. Margin at 10x = $1.62.\n\nThis is the same problem as DOT - a tiny position with insufficient margin.\n\nLet me check the Binance API directly to confirm the actual position size.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_kZLsMxyCJofvANnOpRGO8905","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace && python3 -c \"\nimport sys; sys.path.insert(0, 'scripts')\nfrom binance_auto_trade import get_all_positions, request\nimport json\n\n# Get full position details\nresult = request('GET', '/fapi/v2/positionRisk')\npositions = result if isinstance(result, list) else []\nfor p in positions:\n    amt = float(p.get('positionAmt', 0) or 0)\n    if abs(amt) > 0:\n        entry = float(p.get('entryPrice', 0) or 0)\n        mark = float(p.get('markPrice', 0) or 0)\n        lev = float(p.get('leverage', 0) or 0)\n        margin = float(p.get('isolatedWallet', 0) or 0) if p.get('marginType') == 'isolated' else float(p.get('positionInitialMargin', 0) or 0)\n        notional = abs(amt) * mark\n        print(f'{p[\\\"symbol\\\"]}: qty={amt}, entry={entry}, mark={mark}, lev={lev}x, margin={margin}, notional={notional:.2f}, PN={p[\\\"unRealizedProfit\\\"]}')\n\" 2>&1","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1096,"output":697,"cacheRead":38016,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39809,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1781087891039}}
