{"type":"message","id":"37c03069","parentId":"bf3772e4","timestamp":"2026-06-10T10:39:59.452Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\"ReduceOnly Order is rejected\" - this error usually means the reduceOnly order would increase the position instead of reducing it. This could happen if:\n\n1. The position direction from Binance is different from what we think\n2. There's an existing opposite-direction order that would conflict\n3. The position side (LONG/SHORT vs BOTH) doesn't match\n\nLooking at the position: ETHUSDT qty=0.008, positive. So it's a LONG position. To close it, we should SELL. And the script correctly calculates side=SELL.\n\nBut the error -2022 \"ReduceOnly Order is rejected\" typically means the reduce-only order would NOT reduce the position. This could happen if:\n\n1. The position is actually in SHORT mode (positionSide=BOTH) and we're on the wrong side\n2. There's a hedge mode issue\n\nActually, looking at the error more carefully - the place_order function might be doing something different. Let me check if the place_order function in binance_auto_trade.py handles reduce_only correctly, or if there's something about position mode (dual position mode).\n\nActually, I think the issue might be that the binance_auto_trade.py place_order function is sending the order, and with reduce_only=True, it's checking if the order would actually reduce the position. If the position info is stale or there's a mismatch, it gets rejected.\n\nLet me try a different approach: use the existing close_all_positions function, or directly place the order to close this position.\n\nActually wait, let me re-read the error more carefully. The place_order function says \"ETHUSDT 主单失败，跳过 SL/TP 提交\" and then shows the Binance error. The reduce_only might be conflicting with something in the place_order function that adds TP/SL orders.\n\nLet me look at the place_order function to understand how it handles reduce_only.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_EX1e310pzRizWV4pgVmk4613","name":"read","arguments":{"offset":467,"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/binance_auto_trade.py","limit":80}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":539,"output":888,"cacheRead":44416,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45843,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1781087987374}}
{"type":"message","id":"30d50cbd","parentId":"37c03069","timestamp":"2026-06-10T10:39:59.515Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_EX1e310pzRizWV4pgVmk4613","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"def place_order(symbol, side, quantity, leverage=10, tp_price=None, sl_price=None, price=0, reduce_only=False):\n    \"\"\"\n    下单\n    \n    Args:\n        symbol: 币种符号 (如 BTCUSDT)\n        side: BUY/SELL\n        quantity: 数量\n        leverage: 杠杆倍数 (默认 10x)\n        tp_price: 止盈价格 (可选)\n        sl_price: 止损价格 (可选)\n        price: 当前价格（用于计算精度）\n        reduce_only: 是否只减仓（平仓时用，不受最低金额限制）\n    \"\"\"\n    # 2026-03-28 老公指示：开仓前先设置逐仓模式\n    if not reduce_only:\n        set_isolated_margin(symbol)\n    \n    # 格式化数量和价格（根据 Binance 精度要求）\n    formatted_quantity = format_quantity(symbol.replace(\"USDT\", \"\"), quantity, price) if price > 0 else quantity\n    formatted_tp = format_price(tp_price) if tp_price else None\n    formatted_sl = format_price(sl_price) if sl_price else None\n    \n    log_order_info(symbol, side, formatted_quantity, price, formatted_tp, formatted_sl, reduce_only)\n    \n    # 1. 设置杠杆（reduce_only 时跳过）\n    if not reduce_only:\n        leverage_result = request(\"POST\", \"/fapi/v1/leverage\", {\n            \"symbol\": symbol,\n            \"leverage\": leverage\n        })\n    else:\n        leverage_result = {\"skipped\": True}\n    \n    # 2. 下单\n    order_params = {\n        \"symbol\": symbol,\n        \"side\": side,\n        \"type\": \"MARKET\",\n        \"quantity\": formatted_quantity,\n        \"reduceOnly\": str(reduce_only).lower()\n    }\n    \n    order_result = request(\"POST\", \"/fapi/v1/order\", order_params)\n    \n    # 主单失败时直接返回，不要再下 SL/TP（避免无主单的孤儿挂单）\n    main_order_ok = isinstance(order_result, dict) and bool(order_result.get(\"orderId\"))\n    if not main_order_ok:\n        log.error(f\"🔴 {symbol} 主单失败，跳过 SL/TP 提交。原始响应：{order_result}\")\n    \n    # 3. 设置止盈止损（Algo Order API，避免 -4120）\n    if main_order_ok and formatted_sl:\n        sl_side = \"SELL\" if side == \"BUY\" else \"BUY\"\n        sl_result = place_algo_conditional_order(\n            symbol, sl_side, \"STOP_MARKET\", formatted_sl, quantity=formatted_quantity\n        )\n        if isinstance(sl_result, dict) and sl_result.get(\"algoId\"):\n            log.info(\n                f\"📌 {symbol} 止损 Algo 单已提交：{formatted_sl} algoId={sl_result.get('algoId')}\"\n            )\n        else:\n            log.warning(f\"⚠️ {symbol} 止损单提交失败：{sl_result}\")\n\n    if main_order_ok and formatted_tp:\n        tp_side = \"SELL\" if side == \"BUY\" else \"BUY\"\n        tp_result = place_algo_conditional_order(\n            symbol, tp_side, \"TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET\", formatted_tp, quantity=formatted_quantity\n        )\n        if isinstance(tp_result, dict) and tp_result.get(\"algoId\"):\n            log.info(\n                f\"📌 {symbol} 止盈 Algo 单已提交：{formatted_tp} algoId={tp_result.get('algoId')}\"\n            )\n        else:\n            log.warning(f\"⚠️ {symbol} 止盈单提交失败：{tp_result}\")\n    \n    # 检查订单是否成功（严格判断：必须有 orderId）\n    # 🐛 2026-04-27 修复：原 `\"code\" in str(order_result)` 判断在某些 Binance 字段\n    #     里可能误判（如未来新增字段名含 code），改为「正向判断有 orderId」\n    order_success = False\n    order_msg = \"\"\n\n[107 more lines in file. Use offset=547 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1781087999500}}
{"type":"message","id":"31dc469f","parentId":"30d50cbd","timestamp":"2026-06-10T10:40:10.019Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see the issue. When place_order is called with reduce_only=True, it sends `\"reduceOnly\": \"true\"` to the Binance API. The error -2022 \"ReduceOnly Order is rejected\" means the order would not reduce the position.\n\nThis could be because:\n1. The position might actually be SHORT (negative amount) but the code thinks it's LONG\n2. Or there's a position mode issue (hedge mode vs one-way mode)\n\nWait, from the earlier query, ETHUSDT qty=0.008 (positive), so it's LONG. To close a LONG, we SELL. The code correctly sets side=SELL.\n\nBut the error says \"ReduceOnly Order is rejected\". This typically happens when:\n- You're in hedge mode (positionSide=BOTH) and sending on the wrong side\n- Or the position doesn't exist on that side\n\nWait, could the issue be that Binance has already cancelled/closed the position or there's a pending order? Let me check if there are open orders for ETHUSDT.\n\nActually, let me try a different approach: just use the close_all_positions function from binance_auto_trade.py which might handle this differently. Or I can directly call the Binance API to close the ETH position.\n\nLet me first check if there are open orders for ETH.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_irgFxeitUPTDlQVQ8bFx9407","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace && python3 -c \"\nimport sys; sys.path.insert(0, 'scripts')\nfrom binance_auto_trade import request, cancel_all_orders\n\n# Check open orders\norders = request('GET', '/fapi/v1/openOrders', {'symbol': 'ETHUSDT'})\nprint('ETH Open Orders:', orders)\n\n# Also check position info again\npos = request('GET', '/fapi/v2/positionRisk', {'symbol': 'ETHUSDT'})\nif isinstance(pos, list) and len(pos) > 0:\n    p = pos[0]\n    print(f'positionAmt={p[\\\"positionAmt\\\"]}, positionSide={p.get(\\\"positionSide\\\",\\\"N/A\\\")}')\n\" 2>&1","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":953,"output":785,"cacheRead":45440,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":47178,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1781087999530}}
