{"type":"message","id":"8e0555db","parentId":"c19b8bef","timestamp":"2026-06-10T10:54:43.899Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_w4B7PMfvDICLl1cz1bFc4832","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"def open_position(\n    symbol: str,\n    direction: str,\n    entry_price: float,\n    score: int,\n    tp_sl: dict,\n    regime: str,\n    ai_result: Optional[dict] = None,\n) -> dict:\n    # 2026-04-27 老公指示：下单前最后一道闸门 —— Binance API 实时确认无同币种持仓\n    # 防止多进程/race condition 重复开仓（之前 12 秒内开 2 次 XRP / SSL EOF 后又开一次 BNB 都是这个 bug）\n    try:\n        _api_pos = get_all_positions() or []\n        if any(p.get(\"symbol\") == symbol \n               and float(p.get(\"amount\", 0)) != 0\n               and abs(float(p.get(\"amount\", 0))) * float(p.get(\"entry_price\", 0)) >= 5.0 \n               for p in _api_pos):\n            log.warning(f\"🚫 {symbol} 下单闸门：API 已有持仓，拒绝重复下单\")\n            return {\n                \"symbol\": symbol, \"type\": direction, \"entry_price\": entry_price,\n                \"qty\": 0, \"amount\": 0, \"score\": score, \"regime\": regime,\n                \"ai_result\": ai_result,\n                \"order_result\": {\"success\": False, \"message\": \"API 已有持仓，拒绝重复下单\"},\n                \"entry_time\": datetime.now().isoformat(),\n                \"high_24h\": 0.0, \"low_24h\": 0.0, \"peak_pnl\": 0.0,\n                **tp_sl,\n            }\n    except Exception as _e:\n        log.warning(f\"⚠️ 下单闸门查持仓异常：{_e}（继续走流程）\")\n\n    # 🔒 防御：价格无效（0 或异常大）时拒绝下单\n    if not entry_price or entry_price <= 0 or entry_price > 1_000_000:\n        log.error(f\"🚫 {symbol} 价格异常 entry_price={entry_price}，拒绝开仓\")\n        return {\n            \"symbol\": symbol, \"type\": direction, \"entry_price\": entry_price,\n            \"qty\": 0, \"amount\": 0, \"score\": score, \"regime\": regime,\n            \"ai_result\": ai_result,\n            \"order_result\": {\"success\": False, \"message\": f\"价格异常 entry_price={entry_price}\"},\n            \"entry_time\": datetime.now().isoformat(),\n            \"high_24h\": 0.0, \"low_24h\": 0.0, \"peak_pnl\": 0.0,\n            **tp_sl,\n        }\n\n    size_pct = CONFIG[\"position_size_pct\"]\n    if regime == \"volatile\":\n        size_pct *= 0.6\n\n    # 计算数量并格式化到正确精度\n    raw_qty = (CONFIG[\"total_capital\"] * size_pct * 10) / entry_price  # 2026-03-28 老公指示：加 10x 杠杆\n    qty = format_quantity(symbol, raw_qty, entry_price)\n\n    # 实盘交易调用\n    order_result = None\n    if AUTO_TRADE_ENABLED:\n        try:\n            # 调用 binance_auto_trade 模块下单\n            side = \"BUY\" if direction == \"LONG\" else \"SELL\"\n            order_result = place_order(\n                symbol=f\"{symbol}USDT\",\n                side=side,\n                quantity=round(qty, 6),\n                leverage=10,  # 2026-03-27 老公指示：3x→10x 测试两天\n                tp_price=tp_sl.get(\"tp1_price\"),\n                sl_price=tp_sl.get(\"sl_price\"),\n                price=entry_price,\n                reduce_only=False,\n            )\n            log.info(f\"📝 下单结果：{order_result}\")\n        except Exception as e:\n            log.error(f\"❌ 下单失败：{e}\")\n            order_result = {\"error\": str(e)}\n\n    pos = {\n        \"symbol\":       symbol,\n        \"type\":         direction,\n        \"entry_price\":  entry_price,\n        \"entry_time\":   datetime.now().isoformat(),\n        \"qty\":          round(qty, 6),\n        \"amount\":       round(qty, 6),  # 与 get_all_positions 返回格式一致，用于盈亏计算\n        \"score\":        score,\n        \"regime\":       regime,\n        \"ai_result\":    ai_result,\n        \"order_result\": order_result,\n        \"high_24h\":     0.0,\n        \"low_24h\":      0.0,\n        \"peak_pnl\":     0.0,\n        **tp_sl,\n    }\n\n    # 检查订单是否真正成功（默认 False，强制要求 place_order 显式返回 success=True）\n    order_success = False\n    if isinstance(order_result, dict):\n        order_success = bool(order_result.get('success', False))\n    \n    msg = (\n        f\"🟢 开多 {symbol}\" if direction == \"LONG\" else f\"🔴 开空 {symbol}\"\n    ) + f\" @{entry_price} | 评分:{score} | 状态:{regime}\"\n    if ai_result:\n        msg += f\" | AI:{ai_result.get('direction')}({ai_result.get('confidence')}%)\"\n    if not order_success:\n\n[1618 more lines in file. Use offset=1188 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1781088883880}}
{"type":"message","id":"ef401416","parentId":"8e0555db","timestamp":"2026-06-10T10:55:04.476Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I understand the issue. Let me trace through the whole flow:\n\n1. When ETH went from SHORT to LONG, the `check_exits_fast` function detected a position that needs to be closed.\n\n2. The close_position function is called with a `size_ratio` (1.0 for full close).\n\n3. But look at line 1248: \n```python\nactual_qty = pos.get(\"qty\", 0)\ntry:\n    from binance_auto_trade import get_all_positions\n    for ap in (get_all_positions() or []):\n        if ap.get(\"symbol\") == symbol:\n            api_amt = abs(float(ap.get(\"amount\", 0) or 0))\n            if api_amt > 0:\n                actual_qty = api_amt\n                break\nexcept Exception:\n    pass\n```\n\nThis gets the ACTUAL position from the API to close. Good.\n\nBut wait - after close_position is called for SL/TP, the `check_exits_fast` returns closed positions, and then the code at line 2507:\n```python\nif reason == \"TP1\":\n    sym_closed = pos['symbol']\n    positions.remove(pos)\n    save_positions(positions)\n```\n\nAnd then at line 2546:\n```python\nif reason == \"SL\":\n    ...\n```\n\nNow, after these exits are handled, the next signal check loop happens (around line 2600+), and if there's a new signal for the same symbol, it goes to open_position.\n\nNow the key question: where does the mini position come from?\n\nLet me think about this differently. The ETH was SHORT at $1642 in the morning. Then it became LONG at $1622 in the evening. The new LONG position only has 0.008 ETH.\n\nIf the close_position function worked correctly, it would have closed the SHORT position (which was presumably a normal-sized position ~0.123 ETH from earlier calculations). Then the open_position function should have opened a new LONG with ~0.123 ETH.\n\nBut the actual API shows the new LONG only has 0.008 ETH. \n\nWait - let me re-read the close_position function's fallback steps more carefully:\n\n1. First attempt: reduce_only=True → failed with -2022\n2. Second attempt: reduce_only=False → might have failed with -4164 (minimum notional)\n3. Third attempt: supplement margin\n4. Fourth attempt: pad position if notional < $20\n5. Fifth attempt: last resort\n\nIf the SHORT position was being closed, and the close_order failed repeatedly, could it be that:\n- The close partially executed, leaving a tiny residual?\n- Or the close attempt failed entirely, and then the position was later closed by another mechanism?\n\nActually, wait. Let me re-read the close_position fallback logic:\n\n```python\n# 降级3：名义价值 < $20 → 买入≥$20 名义价值的量撑大后全平\nif order_code == -4164 and not position_padded and current_price > 0:\n    notional = qty * current_price\n    if notional < 20:\n        pad_qty = 20.0 / current_price\n        pad_qty = format_quantity(symbol, pad_qty, current_price)\n        if pad_qty > 0:\n            pad_side = \"BUY\" if typ == \"LONG\" else \"SELL\"\n            r = place_order(symbol=sym_usdt, side=pad_side, quantity=pad_qty,...)\n```\n\nIf the original SHORT position was being closed:\n- Type = SHORT\n- To close SHORT: side = BUY\n- But the notional might be too small for the close BUY order → -4164\n- Fallback 3: pad_qty = 20/price. For ETH at $1622: pad_qty = 0.0123 → round to 0.012 ETH = $19.51 → STILL below $20!\n\nWait, $19.51 is still below $20! So the pad would fail too with -4164. Then the function gives up after 5 attempts?\n\nLet me look at what happens after the 5 attempts.\n\nActually, let me look more carefully. Let me read the rest of the close_position function to see what happens after all the retries.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_v7VR0PDbPcSReVaQqdcn7391","name":"read","arguments":{"offset":1349,"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","limit":80}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-