{"type":"message","id":"362ba2cf","parentId":"d9265617","timestamp":"2026-06-10T10:57:11.496Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I need to restart the monitor for the changes to take effect. But I should also handle the fact that `close_position` with reduce_only=True will fail for mini positions (as we saw with ETH). The close_position function already has fallback logic for this (retries with reduce_only=False, padding, etc.). Let me verify it handles the -2022 case properly.\n\nLooking at close_position code:\n1. First attempt: reduce_only=True → fails with -2022\n2. Falls to `if attempt == 0 and order_code == -2022`: retries with reduce_only=False\n3. reduce_only=False → fails with -4164 (notional < $20)\n4. Falls to `if order_code == -4164 and not margin_replenished`: adds margin → still -4164\n5. Falls to `if order_code == -4164 and not position_padded`: pads with BUY/SELL → then closes\n\nThis should work! The close_position function already handles all the fallback cases.\n\nNow, about restarting: the AGENTS.md says I should remind the husband to restart (kj) after code changes, and not proactively suggest or execute destructive operations. So I should tell him to restart.\n\nLet me summarize:\n1. ✅ Found the root cause: reconstruction code updates local cache but doesn't fix Binance position\n2. ✅ Fixed: added auto-repair logic that closes mini positions and reopens with correct size\n3. Need to tell husband to restart (kj)","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"改好了。核心修复：\n\n**重建代码新增迷你仓自动修复：** 当 API 实际持仓量 < 风控标准 80% 时，自动调用 `close_position`（含完整降级链路）平掉迷你仓，再用标准量重开。不再只改本地缓存骗自己。\n\n比较关键的是复用了 `close_position` 而不是自己重写平仓逻辑 —— 它已经有 reduceOnly 降级、-4164 补保证金、名义不足补仓撑大等 5 次重试策略，之前 ETH 那个棘手的 $13 迷你仓也能处理。\n\n改完需要重启生效，你空了跑下 `kj`。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":135,"output":770,"cacheRead":80896,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":81801,"cost":{"input