{"type":"message","id":"1f478bf5","parentId":"a7441c1c","timestamp":"2026-06-10T11:14:40.428Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The husband is asking whether my fix applies to all coins or only ETH. Let me think about this.\n\nThe fix I made is in the reconstruction/sync code of `crypto_signal_monitor.py`. The code iterates through ALL positions from the API:\n\n```python\nfor p in api_positions:\n    amt = float(p.get('amount', 0))\n    entry = float(p.get('entry_price', 0))\n    if amt != 0 and abs(amt) * entry >= 5.0:\n        symbol = p['symbol']\n        ...\n```\n\nFor each position, it calculates the expected quantity based on risk rules and compares with the actual API amount. If the ratio is < 80% (for ANY symbol), it triggers the repair logic.\n\nSo yes, this fix is universal - it applies to all 7 coins (BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB, DOT, LINK, XRP). The logic checks `size_ratio < 0.8` regardless of which symbol it is.\n\nThe fix is symbol-agnostic. It doesn't hardcode \"ETH\" or \"DOT\" anywhere.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"全部币种都生效的。逻辑是通用的 —— 每次 API 同步时遍历所有持仓，不管哪个币种，只要 Binance 实际量不到风控标准的 80%，就自动触发修复：平掉迷你仓 → 用正确数量重开。BTC/ETH/SOL/BNB/DOT/LINK/XRP 一视同仁 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":368,"output":545,"cacheRead":81408,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":82321,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1781090072299}}
