{"type":"message","id":"0b2a51f6","parentId":"b93f8f6c","timestamp":"2026-06-10T12:29:09.261Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze the current situation:\n\n1. DOT has a new SHORT position. Let me check if the size is correct this time.\n2. Health check is all green (13/13).\n3. The monitor was restarted (new PIDs: 21926, 21946, etc.)\n\nLet me check DOT's quantity specifically to see if the fix worked.\n\nFrom the position query:\n- DOT SHORT: entry $0.929, current $0.9312, PnL -0.48 USDT (-0.24%)\n- The PnL is -0.48, and price moved 0.0022 against the position. If qty × 0.0022 = 0.48, then qty ≈ 218. That seems like a normal-sized position.\n\nActually wait, let me calculate: 218 DOT × $0.929 = $202.5 notional. At 10x, margin = $20.25. That's about right!\n\nLet me verify more precisely. The DOT price precision is 1 decimal. So qty should be around 215-216 DOT (200 / 0.929 = 215.3, rounded to 215.3... wait, DOT precision is 1 decimal for quantity, so it would be 215.3).\n\nActually, the PnL shows -0.48 USDT. If price moved from 0.929 to 0.9312, that's 0.0022 against a SHORT. So qty = 0.48 / 0.0022 = 218.2. But that doesn't quite match the precision (DOT has 1 decimal). Hmm, maybe it's -0.48 rounded. Let's see: if qty = 215.3, PnL = 215.3 × 0.0022 = 0.474 → rounds to 0.47 or 0.48 depending on rounding. Close enough.\n\nSo the DOT position now has:\n- ~215 DOT × $0.929 = ~$200 notional\n- Margin ≈ $20\n- This is CORRECT!\n\nWait, but the monitor was already restarted? The health check shows new PIDs (21926, 21946, 21920, 21936). The husband must have run `kj` already. And the fix is now live.\n\nLet me verify DOT's actual quantity from the API to confirm the fix is working.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"DOT 新开的空仓，让我验一下数量对不对。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_ew7TmHZPzyInvI3SACni1616","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace && python3 -c \"\nimport sys; sys.path.insert(0, 'scripts')\nfrom binance_auto_trade import request\n\nfor p in request('GET', '/fapi/v2/positionRisk'):\n    amt = float(p.get('positionAmt',0) or 0)\n    if abs(amt) > 0:\n        entry = float(p.get('entryPrice',0))\n        mark = float(p.get('markPrice',0))\n        notional = abs(amt) * mark\n        margin = notional / 10\n        print(f'{p[\\\"symbol\\\"]}: qty={abs(amt):.3f}, 名义=\\${notional:.1f}, 保证金≈\\${margin:.1f}, PN={p[\\\"unRealizedProfit\\\"]}')\n\" 2>&1 | grep -v Insecure\\|warning\\|warn","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":853,"output":1295,"cacheRead":82304,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":84452,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1781094533575}}
